title: Microsoft app authorize to localhost from a foreign page
severity: medium
score: 30
tags: consent-phishing
attack: T1528
description: A non-Microsoft, non-allowlisted page shows an Entra authorize URL for a first-party
  app with a localhost redirect_uri. This is the structural half of ConsentFix. The rule
  fires even when the page does not render the paste-back instruction.
---
// See firstparty_loopback_authorize in _shared.kql.
firstparty_loopback_authorize
